        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-front-display-hand.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo pre-orders start tomorrow, and if you want the fastest checkout possible, Apple just set the deadline for completing its ‘Get Ready’ process.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074325\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/apple-sets-cutoff-time-for-getting-fastest-iphone-duo-pre-order/#more-1074325\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
