        "title": "Apple calls iPhone Duo pre-order demand ‘extraordinary’ as shipping dates slip",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/apple-calls-iphone-duo-pre-order-demand-extraordinary-as-shipping-dates-slip/",
