        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-18-pro-vs-iphone-duo-heres-every-key-difference/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-vs-iphone-duo-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has strong pitches for all of its flagship iPhones this fall, but which model is right for you? Here’s an overview of the key differences between iPhone Duo and iPhone 18 Pro.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-18-pro,iphone-18-pro-max,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1068807\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-18-pro-vs-iphone-duo-heres-every-key-difference/#more-1068807\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
